# Request: forward a batch of camera bin detections for fusion via the
# probabilistic data association update on the warehouse cache.
#
# Provide either bay_key OR shelf_key (bay_key wins if both are non-empty).
#
#   bay_key   - e.g. "X1-01". Multi-shelf fusion: warehouse partitions
#               detections by detection.center.z against the bay's shelves
#               and runs PDA per shelf. Detections whose z falls outside
#               every shelf bracket are counted in `clutter` and dropped.
#   shelf_key - e.g. "X1-01-A". Legacy single-shelf fusion: every detection
#               is assumed to belong to the named shelf (no z partitioning).
string bay_key
string shelf_key
r1_interfaces/BinDetection[] detections
---
bool success
string message
float32 best_bin_confidence              # post-update confidence of the order's target bin (0 if N/A)
int32 matched                            # sum across shelves when bay_key was used
int32 missed                             # sum across shelves when bay_key was used
int32 clutter                            # includes z-bracket misses when bay_key was used
